{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"以賽亞書","commonName":"以賽亞書","title":"以賽亞書","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"37240f583e914ba42181e29fd451e0e08b4e7c4e2af1563522da6f6a9285f631","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":65,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["懲罰與拯救"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"耶和華說：「我向沒有求問我的人顯現，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"讓沒有尋找我的人尋見，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"對沒有求告我名的國家說，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"『我在這裡，我在這裡！』","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我整天伸出雙手招呼那悖逆的子民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們卻任意妄為，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不走正路。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們不斷地當面惹我發怒。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在園中獻祭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在磚臺上燒香。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們坐在墳場裡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"宿在隱秘處。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們吃豬肉，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"鍋裡有不潔之物做的湯。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們對人說，『站遠點，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"別挨近我，因為我比你聖潔！』","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我被這些人氣得鼻孔冒煙，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"整天怒火難息。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看啊，這些都記錄在我面前，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我不會再保持緘默，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要報應他們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"按他們和他們祖先的罪報應他們。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必按他們之前的所作所為報應他們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為他們在山上燒香，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在丘陵上褻瀆我。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"耶和華說：「人發現一串葡萄尚可釀造新酒時，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"一定會說，『不要毀壞它，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"裡面還有好葡萄。』","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"同樣，因我僕人的緣故，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我也不會把他們全部毀滅。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"「我必使雅各的後裔興起，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使猶大人興起，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"繼承我的群山。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我揀選的子民必擁有那片土地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的僕人必在那裡安居。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"沙崙必成為牧放羊群的草場，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"亞割谷必成為牛群休憩的地方，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這些地方必屬於尋求我的人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"至於你們這些背棄我耶和華、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"忘記我的聖山、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"擺宴供奉幸運之神、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"斟滿調和酒祭奠命運之神的人，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要使你們註定被殺，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們都要喪身刀下。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為我呼喚你們，你們不回應；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我講話，你們不聆聽。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們做我視為惡的事，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"專行令我不悅的事。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"text":"所以主耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「看啊，我的僕人必有吃有喝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們卻要饑渴交加；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的僕人必歡喜，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們卻要受羞辱；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的僕人因心裡歡喜而歌唱，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們卻因心裡悲傷而哭喊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因傷心欲絕而嚎啕大哭。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的選民必用你們的名字作咒詛，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主耶和華必殺死你們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"給祂的僕人另起名字。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，在地上求福祉的人都必向信實的上帝祈求，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在地上起誓的人都必憑信實的上帝起誓。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為過去的苦難已經被遺忘，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從我眼前消失了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["新天新地"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"text":"「看啊，我要創造新天新地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"過去的一切都要被遺忘，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從記憶中消失。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們要因我的創造而永遠歡喜快樂。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看啊，我要造充滿喜樂的耶路撒冷，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在城中造歡樂的居民。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必因耶路撒冷而歡喜，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因我的子民而快樂。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"城裡再聽不見哭泣和哀號聲。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"再沒有只活幾天便夭折的嬰兒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也沒有壽數未滿便去世的老人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為滿了百歲而終的人不過算是青年，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"壽數不足百歲的人被視為受了咒詛。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們要建造房屋居住，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"栽種葡萄園，吃園中的果子。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們建的房屋再不會被別人居住，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們種的果實再不會被別人享用。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的子民必像樹木一樣長壽，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我揀選的人必長享自己親手勞碌的成果。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們不會徒勞，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們生的孩子也不會遇到災禍，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為他們及其子孫是蒙耶和華賜福的後裔。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們還沒有求告，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我就已經應允；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們正在禱告，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我就已經垂聽。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"豺狼和綿羊必一起吃草，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"獅子必像牛一樣吃草，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"蛇必以塵土為食。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在我的整個聖山上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"牠們都不傷人，不害物。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。」","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/65.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/66.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/64.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":24}